{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Arrowman Demo, where you can start the journey of Arrowman by dodging traps, fighting with Nightmares, and climbing using your arrows as platforms! This demo will take you through the beginning of the game in the place called Arrowtown. The next Arrowman was supposed to come from Arrowtown, but in the meantime, disaster struck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047050/extras/8580e6791cd8cc7734876ec6f7a3921c.poster.avif?t=1761219994\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047050/extras/8580e6791cd8cc7734876ec6f7a3921c.webm?t=1761219994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047050/extras/8580e6791cd8cc7734876ec6f7a3921c.mp4?t=1761219994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo focuses on the introductory part of the game, and offers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Boss fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Different types of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introductory conversations with the Guardians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Masks with its powers and upgrade system for it (during the demo you won\u2019t been able to unlock all upgrades)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Bow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Arrow types</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version of the game will start in the same area but will offer more paths and secrets to explore unlocking unique levels.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047050?t=1761219994","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground